            "title": "New Equipment",
            "subtitle": "",
            "text": "<p>Equip your space with premium new equipment built for long-term performance. French Fitness and selected partner brands cover every category, from strength to cardio, so your entire setup matches in quality and design. French Fitness equipment ships with lifetime frame, 10-year parts, and 1-year labor coverage. Selected partner brands include their manufacturer warranties.</p>",
